1 REM FBCS EXC-0231
2 REM CLAIM A-12.1.4-TR151
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 12.1.2 prod. 6 y 15, 12.1.4 l.8857-8860: empty detached handler in an internal SUB: the SUB goes on after END WHEN.
10 SUB S
20 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
30   CAUSE EXCEPTION 1
